% Conoscenza generale dal wiki — dominio: law.
%
% Sta qui per SORGENTE, non per specializzazione: ogni `wiki_concept` viene da
% una pagina, letta con una regola di sintesi deterministica (scripts/learn.py,
% nessun modello). La conoscenza specialistica si raffina altrove, in
% kb/experts/, con predicati che non sono `wiki_*`.

% law / Contract
% source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contract
% revision: 1372153721; processed: 2026-09-03T10:47:59Z
wiki_concept(contract, law, "agreement that specifies certain legally enforceable rights and obligations pertaining to two or more parties").

% law / Obligation
% source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Obligation
% revision: 1365171949; processed: 2026-09-03T10:48:04Z
wiki_concept(obligation, law, "course of action which someone is required to take, be it a legal obligation or a moral obligation").

% law / Property
% source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Property
% revision: 1369793918; processed: 2026-09-03T10:48:10Z
wiki_concept(property, law, "system of rights that gives people legal control of valuable things, and also refers to the valuable things themselves").
